  articleID: 
  title: Thief Arrested
  headliner: <b>Thief Arrested for Using Stolen Credit Cards to pay for Meals</b>
  bodyText: "Apprehended thief, identified as Karl Jackson, turned a routine police
    dragnet outside a neighborhood eatery into an impromptu Shakespearean tragedy
    after being taken into custody mid-dinner. \r\n\r\nShouting at officers while
    being shoved toward a squad car, the patron demanded to know his alleged crime,
    in which he asked, \"What is the charge? Eating a meal? A succulent Chinese meal?\"
    as confused bystanders watched."
